{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "84aff30a-6256-8b1a-b285-4c5d77fca319",
  "created_at": "2025-12-17T11:31:06-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Richard Hazard",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:27:56-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:28:00-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. Yeah. [pause] I'm hoping to open a small shop here in Newport, and I'm trying to figure out the business license. What forms I need, that kind of thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:28:10-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Happy to point you in the right direction. What kind of shop are you planning? Retail, food, something else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:28:17-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Retail. Just, um, candles and some home goods. Nothing with food. Nothing, you know, loud."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:28:23-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. So for a retail shop, you'd generally start with a business license application through our office. There may also be a zoning check for the location, depending on where it is. Do you have a space picked out yet?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:28:36-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sort of. I have a lease I'm looking at. I haven't signed. Is the zoning thing a separate form? [pause] Or is that the same form?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:28:45-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Separate, usually. The license application is one thing, and zoning is handled by a different office. They'd confirm that a shop is allowed at that address. I'd suggest checking that before you sign anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:28:56-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. Okay. So I do zoning first, then the license? Or the license first?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:29:01-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning first makes the most sense, since the license depends on the location being approved for what you're doing. Then you bring that along with the license application."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:29:11-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. Okay. And what's the fee? For the license."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:29:15-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't have the exact amount in front of me, and it can depend on the type of business. It's listed on the application, and I can have someone confirm it for you. Do you want to give me a number to call back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:29:29-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, yeah. Hang on. I'm on a borrowed phone, actually. My phone's dead, I left the charger somewhere. I don't know this number. [pause] Can you see it on your end?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:29:40-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It may show up on my screen. Let me look. Hm, it's coming up, but I want to be sure I read it right. Is it okay if I read it back to you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:29:51-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:29:53-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four zero one, five five five, zero one eight seven. Does that sound right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:29:58-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I honestly don't know. That's what the person said, I think. I'll just say it's that one. If it's wrong I'll call you back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:30:06-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. I'll note it. Also, you can pick up the application here at the counter, or I can tell you where to find it on the city website."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:30:16-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wait, is it one application or two? The zoning and the license. Sorry, I'm mixing it up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:30:22-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Two. One for the zoning office, and one for the business license here. The license one is ours."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:30:29-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Two. Zoning first. License second. And the fee is on the license form, but you'll call me with the number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:30:36-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Close. I'll have someone confirm the fee and call you back. You can also see it on the form itself if you pick one up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:30:45-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. [pause] Sorry. Long day. And this rain isn't helping, I got soaked getting here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:30:51-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's coming down out there today. We're here until close if you want to stop by, though maybe wait until it eases up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:30:59-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. Maybe tomorrow. Thank you. I think I've got it. Mostly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T11:31:03-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care, Mr. Hazard."
    }
  ],
